---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { media } from '../data/media';
---
<section class="beyond section"><div class="wrap beyond-grid">
  <figure><Image src={media.beyond.src} widths={[480, 760, 1050]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 50vw" alt={media.beyond.alt} loading="lazy" /></figure>
  <div><h2>A life made wider by participation.</h2><p>The most memorable school days are often made in the spaces around formal lessons.</p><div class="fragments"><article><Image src={media.debate.src} widths={[320, 560]} sizes="25vw" alt={media.debate.alt} loading="lazy" /><h3>Debate</h3><p>Ideas, expression and attentive listening.</p></article><article><Image src={media.scouting.src} widths={[320, 560]} sizes="25vw" alt={media.scouting.alt} loading="lazy" /><h3>Scouting</h3><p>Service, teamwork and practical responsibility.</p></article></div><p class="simple-list">Music, Dance &amp; Drama &nbsp; · &nbsp; Faith and community &nbsp; · &nbsp; Student leadership</p></div>
</div></section>
